 aim in this game.\n\nThere are variety of weapons available in this game like bow, knife, guns, crowbar etc. Do you have what it takes to be the best assassin in the world?.", "short_description": "This is a free demo version of full game. It is a action filled first person shooter that lets players take the role of a assassin and undertake missions."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://realitygamesonline.net/HitContracts/PrivacyPolici.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Reality Games Online", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://realitygamesonline.net/HitContracts", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "642992884169805"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974695_390166673146987_4955266697545633500_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5IQSUm9jvpMQ7kNvwF2ywUN&_nc_oc=Adk_f4PIOOjFtb54poGqVUvyWjuzOkXeBChPjRoic7s3rL2fdIwdQSu39SLvdA9HzbA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfynS9NFwzvNjphUpqcp0zq4IpAXV9amd1KWFd1HYH0Bqw&oe=69B808D3"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "(Demo)  Free ", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "27433260